1416→   - 13-15 characters total
1417→
1418→⚠️ VALIDATION (check before answering):
1419→- ONT serial must be exactly 12 chars starting with ALCLB4
1420→- If you read 11 chars, you likely dropped a char at position 7
1421→- If chars after ALCLB4 include M/N/P/R/Y, re-read — those aren't hex
1422→
1423→Respond in this exact JSON format:
1424→{
1425→  "ontSerial": {
